# A real room: 12 hung speakers + 4 extra speakers, 16 moving lights, one projector and its wall image.
# Working study exported from a venue survey; positions are estimates (see [EVIDENCE] / [UNRESOLVED]).
# The [SPEAKER] rows were added for this example and are an assumption, not a confirmed patch.
# Light names were translated from Japanese; house left/right is as seen from the audience (-X / +X here).
# PJ 01's surveyed pose aims along local +Z at the wall image on +X; the source still marks it provisional.

